## Why This Is Asked

- Fills a gap in auditability and data provenance for regulated tenants.
- Tests ability to design tamper-evident, region-aware, privacy-preserving logging.

## Key Concepts

- Append-only provenance, per-tenant KMS keys, envelope encryption, Merkle trees, cross-region replication, provenance graph API, data deletion policy.

## Code Example

```javascript
// Example: sign and emit a provenance event
function signEvent(event, keyId){
  const key = kms.getKey(keyId);
  return hmacSHA256(key, JSON.stringify(event));
}
```

